# R17 survey outputs (added 2026-10-09)
# Scope: exp/offline_search/rounds/r17/** only. DECISION/EVIDENCE/INPUT .md, prompts
# and the survey fetch/probe scripts stay visible. Below: fetched third-party
# material and large generated catalogs.

# Third-party source snapshots fetched by fetch_sources.py (repo clones, paper/site
# HTML, directory listings); re-fetchable from SOURCE_MANIFEST.json
sources/
sources_v2/
code/
raw/

# Package-manager cache created by probe runs
uv_cache/
.venv/

# Large generated catalog (enumerate_hf.py output, ~600 KB)
HF_CATALOG.tsv

# Python caches / logs
__pycache__/
*.log
